      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD953EA51C9810A9F9920262026662F621190A34E2A5728000A5E155E954E9A75595B66768459D059D090017ED962117684FF0C00100001BE00000A4F465B835B9E5728662F975E5E385730518554112026202600100002011401CF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "本来只要我去努力带它社交就好，\n但我也是个很内向的人……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "672C676553EA8981621153BB52AA529B5E265B83793E4EA45C31597DFF0C000A4F4662114E5F662F4E2A5F885185541176844EBA2026202600100002011401CF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也就是说，我的委托内容就是\n请你替我去和10号野生特区里的<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n训练家们搭话吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
