      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就算训练家之间不说话，只要宝可梦们\n能觉得开心，那就已经很棒了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 3256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C317B978BAD7EC35BB64E4B95F44E0D8BF48BDDFF0C53EA89815B9D53EF68A64EEC000A80FD89C95F975F005FC3FF0C90A35C315DF27ECF5F8868D24E86300200100002011401D10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要炫耀一下猫鼬斩的优点，\n所以也请和我说说凉脊龙的优点嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 3332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211898170AB80004E004E0B732B9F2C65A976844F1870B9FF0C000A62404EE54E5F8BF7548C62118BF48BF451C9810A9F9976844F1870B9561B300200100002011401D20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊，好的……\n那个……请多多关照。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 3404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF0C597D768420262026000A90A34E2A202620268BF7591A591A51737167300200100002011401CF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哔耶！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 3448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54D48036FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿C",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 3460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然我这个人性格非常内向，\n但……还请各位多多关照了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 3472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713662118FD94E2A4EBA6027683C975E5E3851855411FF0C000A4F46202620268FD88BF754044F4D591A591A517371674E86300200100002011401CF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哔耶！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 3536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54D48036FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让我们来一边聊宝可梦的话题，\n一边加深对彼此的了解吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 3548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BA962114EEC67654E008FB9804A5B9D53EF68A676848BDD9898FF0C000A4E008FB952A06DF15BF95F7C6B6476844E8689E35427FF0100100002011401D00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咔嚓～！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 3612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54945693FF5EFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就算训练家之间不说话，只要宝可梦们\n能觉得开心，那就已经很棒了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 3624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C317B978BAD7EC35BB64E4B95F44E0D8BF48BDDFF0C53EA89815B9D53EF68A64EEC000A80FD89C95F975F005FC3FF0C90A35C315DF27ECF5F8868D24E86300200100002011401D10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "洽啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 73,
      "offsetInSection": 3700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6D3D554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要炫耀一下猫鼬斩的优点，\n所以也请和我说说凉脊龙的优点嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǒ",
